      <div id="img-sidebar" class="img-sidebar">
        <h1 id="img-title" class="img-sidebar-title">Panoramic View of Chajnantor Plateau</h1>
        <div id="img-description" class="img-sidebar-description"><p>The ALMA Observatory is located in the Chajnantor Plateau over 5000 meters above sea level.  This image shows the immensity of the Chajnantor Plateau.</p>
<p>Credit: Carlos Padilla - AUI/NRAO</p>
</div>
